      * Regression for the limit of RUN: it executes only the entry;
      * a flow that falls through paragraphs needs PERFORM THRU.
       TESTSUITE TSTFALLS 'fall-through from one paragraph to the next'
       PROGRAM FALLS

       TESTCASE 'RUN executes only the first paragraph'
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-STEP
           RUN
           EXPECT WS-STEP TO BE NUMERIC 1
           VERIFY STOP NEVER HAPPENED

       TESTCASE 'PERFORM THRU covers the fall-through and reaches STOP'
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-STEP
           PERFORM A-START THRU B-NEXT
           EXPECT WS-STEP TO BE NUMERIC 2
           VERIFY STOP HAPPENED ONCE
